sequenceDiagram
    participant NB as Notebook
    participant RL as Rotor.load()
    participant TOML as sinha_rotor.toml
    participant R as Rotor
    participant CR as Crack
    participant MF as MisalignmentFlex
    participant TR as TimeResponseResults
    participant PR as Probe

    Note over NB: === Setup Phase ===
    NB->>RL: Rotor.load("sinha_rotor.toml")
    RL->>TOML: Read TOML data
    TOML-->>RL: shaft, disk, bearing element data
    RL->>RL: Reconstruct ShaftElement, DiskElement, BearingElement
    RL->>R: Rotor(shaft_elements, disk_elements, bearing_elements)
    R-->>NB: rotor instance

    Note over NB: === Healthy Baseline ===
    NB->>NB: Build F_healthy force matrix (ndof columns)
    NB->>NB: Compute DOF indices: dof_x, dof_y
    NB->>NB: Fill cos/sin unbalance forces
    NB->>R: run_time_response(speed, F_healthy, t)
    R->>R: time_response() — Newmark integration
    R->>TR: TimeResponseResults(rotor, t, yout, xout)
    TR-->>NB: healthy results

    NB->>PR: Probe(node=probe_node, angle=0.0)
    PR-->>NB: probe instance
    NB->>TR: plot_1d(probe) / plot_dfft(probe)
    TR-->>NB: Plotly Figures

    Note over NB: === Crack Simulation ===
    NB->>R: run_crack(n, depth_ratio=0.43, crack_model="Mayes", ...)
    R->>CR: Crack(rotor, n, depth_ratio, "Mayes")
    CR->>CR: Compute Ko (intact stiffness)
    CR->>CR: Compute Kc (open-crack stiffness)
    CR->>CR: run(node, unb_mag, unb_phase, speed, t)
    CR->>CR: Build breathing function f(theta)
    CR->>R: run_time_response(speed, F, t, add_to_RHS=callback)
    R->>R: Newmark integration with parametric stiffness
    R->>TR: TimeResponseResults(rotor, t, yout, xout)
    TR-->>NB: crack results

    NB->>TR: plot_1d(probe) / plot_dfft(probe)
    TR-->>NB: Plotly Figures (shows 2X, 3X harmonics)

    Note over NB: === Misalignment Simulation ===
    NB->>R: run_misalignment(coupling="flex", n, mis_type="parallel", ...)
    R->>MF: MisalignmentFlex(rotor, n, "parallel", delta_x, delta_y, ...)
    MF->>MF: Compute coupling reaction forces
    MF->>MF: run(node, unb_mag, unb_phase, speed, t)
    MF->>R: run_time_response(speed, F_total, t)
    R->>R: Newmark integration
    R->>TR: TimeResponseResults(rotor, t, yout, xout)
    TR-->>NB: misalignment results

    NB->>TR: plot_1d(probe) / plot_dfft(probe)
    TR-->>NB: Plotly Figures (shows 1X, 2X harmonics)

    Note over NB: === Comparison ===
    NB->>TR: Overlay all three spectra via plot_dfft(fig=fig_overlay)
    NB->>NB: annotate_harmonics(fig, speed, n_max=4)
    TR-->>NB: Combined comparison figure
